flowchart TB
  PLAYER["Player / 3D world view<br/>Set objective · inspect speech, cargo, plans and receipts"]
  subgraph runtime["LOCAL BACKEND · proposed agent runtime"]
    SCENARIO["Versioned world + goal rules<br/>Finite stock · geometry · capacities · deadline"]
    OBS["Per-agent observation builder<br/>Own state + visible facts + addressed inbox<br/>Evidence IDs and observed revision"]
    SCHED["Event-driven scheduler<br/>Wake on need, message, completion or failure<br/>Budget + deadline + deduplication"]
    subgraph actors["LOGICAL AGENTS · separate decision contexts, one worker pool"]
      A["Ruler agent<br/>Observe · remember · decide"]
      B["Pencil agent<br/>Observe · remember · decide"]
      C["Bottle agent<br/>Observe · remember · decide"]
      D["Mug agent<br/>Observe · remember · decide"]
    end
    MODEL["Bounded Gemini model gateway<br/>Independent turns for each actor<br/>Routine motion / receipts need no LLM"]
    ROUTER["Message router + inboxes<br/>Request · offer · accept · report<br/>Persist delivery and reply references"]
    VALID["Deterministic validator + arbiter<br/>Capability · evidence · geometry · freshness<br/>Ownership · inventory · reservations"]
    EXEC["Authoritative action executor<br/>Travel → interact → transfer → build<br/>Atomic action receipt + state transition"]
    OUTBOX["Committed event / outbox dispatcher<br/>At-least-once notification; deduplicate consumers"]
    METRICS["Evidence + evaluation<br/>Transfers · dependencies unblocked<br/>Goal result · cost · matched baselines"]
  end
  DB[("MONGODB ATLAS<br/>World + cargo + projects + agents<br/>Mailboxes + commitments + action ledger<br/>Run budgets + checkpoints + evaluation records")]
  PLAYER -->|objective / permitted commands| SCENARIO
  SCENARIO --> OBS
  OUTBOX --> SCHED
  SCHED --> OBS
  OBS --> A & B & C & D
  A & B & C & D <-->|decision only| MODEL
  A & B & C & D -->|typed proposals| ROUTER
  ROUTER -->|addressed message wakes recipient| SCHED
  ROUTER -->|action / commitment proposal| VALID
  SCENARIO -->|rules and current state| VALID
  VALID -->|accepted action + reservation| EXEC
  VALID -->|rejected with reason; no effect| ROUTER
  EXEC -->|state + receipt + outbox in one transaction| DB
  ROUTER <-->|durable messages / delivery status| DB
  DB -->|canonical state + relevant history| OBS
  DB -->|outbox polling first; optional change-stream wakeups| OUTBOX
  OUTBOX -->|committed facts / animation timeline| PLAYER
  OUTBOX --> METRICS
  METRICS -->|verified outcome and contribution trail| PLAYER
